Description: 
    Implements Bayesian nonparametric modeling of dynamic clusters through an 
    autoregressive logistic-beta Stirling-gamma (AR-LB-SG) process. The package
    uses an efficient Markov chain Monte Carlo algorithm to generate random 
    draws from the posterior distribution of the model parameters. For
    additional details, please see Marin et al. (2026+)
    <https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2601.04625>.
